  "data": {
    "type": "hunting_ruleset",
    "id": "{id}",
    "attributes": {
      "enabled": true,
      "limit": 10,
      "name": "bar",
      "notification_emails": ["notifications@acme.com"],
      "rules": "rule foo {condition: false}"
    }
  }
}
```

Returns the updated [Hunting Ruleset](https://gtidocs.virustotal.com/reference/hunting-ruleset-object) object.

This endpoint returns true if the user has editing access to the Hunting ruleset.

```json Response example
{
    "data": true
}
```
